description = "Flat poison-arrow yield per ReloadCommand (Ranged2.0 C1/#955) — a special AmmoType's per-reload contribution, entity-flat, never scaled by leaf allocation level (specials never scale with leaves). Base 0; owner-tunable starting point, not a tuning pass."
